#: scenario3:scenario3_F74B4BC4_D8C5_4733_9ABF_35269E2F4E1B
#. Edit msgstr; keep protected ⟪k:N⟫ markers in source order.
#. native-sha256: d795d85bb17e456688187ad08a6e369c68ff9485c3334e1633c29d96a7220441
#. default-sha256: 7dec94dd2147fc225fd8bff9d011f432b8be4185be73713fe74ee32764c6bd37
msgctxt "scenario3:scenario3_F74B4BC4_D8C5_4733_9ABF_35269E2F4E1B"
msgid ""
"⟪k:0⟫⟪k:1⟫⟪k:2⟫⟪k:3⟫⟪k:4⟫⟪k:5⟫⟪k:6⟫⟪k:7⟫⟪k:8⟫⟪k:9⟫⟪k:10⟫⟪k:11⟫⟪k:12⟫⟪k:13⟫⟪k:14⟫As I am sure "
"you’re aware,⟪k:15⟫our parents arranged our marriage."
msgstr ""
"⟪k:0⟫⟪k:1⟫⟪k:2⟫⟪k:3⟫⟪k:4⟫⟪k:5⟫⟪k:6⟫⟪k:7⟫⟪k:8⟫⟪k:9⟫⟪k:10⟫⟪k:11⟫⟪k:12⟫⟪k:13⟫⟪k:14⟫Comme vous devez "
"le savoir,⟪k:15⟫ce fut un mariage arrangé par nos parents."

#: scenario3:scenario3_E3921769_2D38_4C09_BE2B_C3FAB8954F5F
#. Edit msgstr; keep protected ⟪k:N⟫ markers in source order.
#. native-sha256: b1f063500638fd3d7d19da9976efec4a3e5e64ffb5b4248df4abfdc720240cf5
#. default-sha256: 790f75c9187074b8c962b9a51a8cd7da2d5fbbc72e9d53846f7bff5edef867d9
msgctxt "scenario3:scenario3_E3921769_2D38_4C09_BE2B_C3FAB8954F5F"
msgid "⟪k:0⟫Before I emigrated to this country to be married,⟪k:1⟫I lived in a misty island nation."
msgstr "⟪k:0⟫Avant de venir dans ce pays pour m’y marier,⟪k:1⟫je vivais dans une île brumeuse."

#: scenario3:scenario3_DAC7B3C0_732D_409E_89FB_BA5DA7F7AA85
#. Edit msgstr; keep protected ⟪k:N⟫ markers in source order.
#. native-sha256: f0447cb78c183a75da9e336691f6e1f9d264866281064a19e50ac90d77307474
#. default-sha256: 440eb0ce59bd0ed90e1cf8c1314dd3a6ee6b84f2bbe0fcd5c88a98e2adfd678a
msgctxt "scenario3:scenario3_DAC7B3C0_732D_409E_89FB_BA5DA7F7AA85"
msgid ""
"⟪k:0⟫Portraits of my ancestors hung in the house where I lived; ⟪k:1⟫I remember as a child "
"wincing in fear at the sight of them staring down at me."
msgstr ""
"⟪k:0⟫Les portraits de mes ancêtres étaient suspendus dans la maison où je vivais ; ⟪k:1⟫je me "
"souviens que l’enfant que j’étais tremblait de peur en sentant leurs regards posés sur moi."

#: scenario3:scenario3_DBE1D544_437A_4EA1_A4AE_72415CC8A542
#. Edit msgstr; keep protected ⟪k:N⟫ markers in source order.
#. native-sha256: 6248652bf1a1e265c3cfcaccaf34ac77ee8348e62b38e009ea161cbb7ce325dd
#. default-sha256: 2d4d0b56a16c0b5f331a7c101b51cc658bc86113dbffd80cb27b5de3265f8e0d
msgctxt "scenario3:scenario3_DBE1D544_437A_4EA1_A4AE_72415CC8A542"
msgid ""
"⟪k:0⟫My mother and father were constantly telling me to show them respect, as it was their hard "
"work that kept our bloodline alive and well."
msgstr ""
"⟪k:0⟫Ma mère et mon père me disaient constamment de leur témoigner du respect, car c’était leur "
"dur labeur qui avait maintenu notre lignée en vie et florissante."

#: scenario3:scenario3_9DD4ED73_16F9_4FFC_9EFC_98614F6F2EE1
#. Edit msgstr; keep protected ⟪k:N⟫ markers in source order.
#. native-sha256: a4cf8e3374e4bdab1fa8020102129b6d7889f06f9fb21e531186d3eb0451ffef
#. default-sha256: 1847e2330a6ff982c24117f4baa0f4da7c3cef8a19b2b8ec080f4867abb1ed1c
msgctxt "scenario3:scenario3_9DD4ED73_16F9_4FFC_9EFC_98614F6F2EE1"
msgid "⟪k:0⟫However, they were fighting an uphill battle to do the same."
msgstr "⟪k:0⟫Pourtant, ils menaient eux-mêmes une lutte de tous les instants pour faire de même."

#: scenario3:scenario3_072A1B06_90A2_4577_BCBE_5C088CD6E1A4
#. Edit msgstr; keep protected ⟪k:N⟫ markers in source order.
#. native-sha256: 4658c08aefa93ea984df858afbeaeb7f2b0eb308d3d7cbd9fcd6a29c4c4c7377
#. default-sha256: 28d1b8d9ba135626639cec450688cdb71d41d694070657e7eb71856df91f704b
msgctxt "scenario3:scenario3_072A1B06_90A2_4577_BCBE_5C088CD6E1A4"
msgid ""
"⟪k:0⟫It would have been clear to anyone reasonably perceptive that our house was coming tumbling "
"down."
msgstr ""
"⟪k:0⟫Il était évident, pour peu qu’on ait un tant soit peu de perspicacité, que notre maison "
"était en train de s’effondrer."

#: scenario3:scenario3_933D312C_E93D_4CEC_AA55_C9D4130C9584
#. Edit msgstr; keep protected ⟪k:N⟫ markers in source order.
#. native-sha256: 34f6fa88db76c0a99998f07a4e71354941e68c82da89b72bdd6f5fb4b3642d3f
#. default-sha256: a911ce7759be474e68482ae89a81dacdaa6433228b2725ab642e2c7701403258
msgctxt "scenario3:scenario3_933D312C_E93D_4CEC_AA55_C9D4130C9584"
msgid ""
"⟪k:0⟫Valuable furniture and paintings slowly disappeared, and eventually, the portraits were gone "
"too."
msgstr ""
"⟪k:0⟫Les meubles de valeur et les peintures disparurent peu à peu et au bout d’un moment les "
"portraits aussi s’en allèrent."

#: scenario3:scenario3_276FA1EE_7BE7_42FE_B7B8_38F135004E9B
#. Edit msgstr; keep protected ⟪k:N⟫ markers in source order.
#. native-sha256: 744d2e87f4989ef1760ddfc15055dfcb3ae46946fffb1d0174739375f9365032
#. default-sha256: 7f9bff56dfbc1924f65f8a8ecb2e8f6053a5c018342d6a299f378d39bca2c20f
msgctxt "scenario3:scenario3_276FA1EE_7BE7_42FE_B7B8_38F135004E9B"
msgid ""
"⟪k:0⟫As our house collapsed, so too did my parents’ health deteriorate, robbing us of any source "
"of income."
msgstr ""
"⟪k:0⟫Au fur et à mesure que la maison s’écroulait, la santé de mes parents aussi se détériorait "
"et nous privait de toute source de revenus."

#: scenario3:scenario3_370DA7F7_699A_42D9_A365_056EF3436F72
#. Edit msgstr; keep protected ⟪k:N⟫ markers in source order.
#. native-sha256: 8097371ea804324f272fbebceca6193ff087d5acb259bfcc8604179886419df2
#. default-sha256: a74fe25a65fa37bb82a455a741ae8e758d0586996c95b19700916d9520f11e37
msgctxt "scenario3:scenario3_370DA7F7_699A_42D9_A365_056EF3436F72"
msgid "⟪k:0⟫And though I was educated, I lacked the skills necessary to obtain work."
msgstr ""
"⟪k:0⟫Et j’avais beau être éduquée, il me manquait les compétences nécessaires pour obtenir du "
"travail."

#: scenario3:scenario3_D3D7A52A_B8DB_4C19_BA09_60E282AE0634
#. Edit msgstr; keep protected ⟪k:N⟫ markers in source order.
#. native-sha256: d479da868104a071b1b3fd91c6e9074c4a2add5ed218eb57b0d4b8f39ebf3c2d
#. default-sha256: 2af2749fc245ea28ce63115476c31e31b7e170b4fca4e8cf191181ae237657bf
msgctxt "scenario3:scenario3_D3D7A52A_B8DB_4C19_BA09_60E282AE0634"
msgid ""
"⟪k:0⟫Just as we were about to run out of money and options, my parents received Jacopo’s parents’ "
"marriage proposition."
msgstr ""
"⟪k:0⟫Juste au moment où nous étions à bout d’argent et de solutions, mes parents reçurent la "
"proposition de mariage des parents de Jacopo."

#: scenario3:scenario3_D3F0987D_A17D_4E12_8D2D_F1D04AA0CB79
#. Edit msgstr; keep protected ⟪k:N⟫ markers in source order.
#. native-sha256: cc0fa63bcb340154bd21d1b598df991945d8b082f0550606b81c49d43888b8b5
#. default-sha256: d61c4bc9b6f7fc2f35d5dcf91e16fe67141a03db520700383093762db1293ddd
msgctxt "scenario3:scenario3_D3F0987D_A17D_4E12_8D2D_F1D04AA0CB79"
msgid ""
"⟪k:0⟫Both of our families stood to benefit from the arrangement.⟪k:1⟫⟪k:2⟫I had social status, "
"and he had wealth."
msgstr ""
"⟪k:0⟫Nos deux familles sortiraient gagnantes de cet arrangement.⟪k:1⟫⟪k:2⟫J’avais le statut "
"social et il avait l’argent."

#: scenario3:scenario3_101759FA_890B_4EFB_81BB_B46CB0E7B3E4
#. Edit msgstr; keep protected ⟪k:N⟫ markers in source order.
#. native-sha256: dc2a05c381433c373df524f0e68d45a08e992e1bb979169d9a9c1fd1d7d49092
#. default-sha256: 46d0590a421e480c0e00c05f0fa09297d749ada72a341cc913462e238d09d39d
msgctxt "scenario3:scenario3_101759FA_890B_4EFB_81BB_B46CB0E7B3E4"
msgid "⟪k:0⟫We each had what the other lacked."
msgstr "⟪k:0⟫Nous avions chacun ce qui manquait à l’autre."

#: scenario3:scenario3_FDFCE645_52E3_4461_A4EA_211D5297E6B4
#. Edit msgstr; keep protected ⟪k:N⟫ markers in source order.
#. native-sha256: 4e712f973488be7934ee9fbc3bb26617d8f1d7f94cfb0d1415cccbfec7f41bdb
#. default-sha256: 274a434a416983dbb7c88ef2f149d5ecb0f89db55585876a75a73356151862a1
msgctxt "scenario3:scenario3_FDFCE645_52E3_4461_A4EA_211D5297E6B4"
msgid ""
"⟪k:0⟫One needs more than money to make it in the world.⟪k:1⟫⟪k:2⟫Without at least a semi-"
"reputable name attached to you,⟪k:3⟫you’re liable to get laughed out of most social gatherings."
msgstr ""
"⟪k:0⟫Pour réussir dans le monde, il ne faut pas seulement de l’argent.⟪k:1⟫⟪k:2⟫Sans une "
"réputation à moitié convenable, on risque d’être moqué et chassé des salons mondains."

#: scenario3:scenario3_3F9E8416_8158_49CE_B53C_3ABD9A69FB6A
#. Edit msgstr; keep protected ⟪k:N⟫ markers in source order.
#. native-sha256: 845abd1e2e3c259bf6d6621497aaf2ec7db1296c8b13be82d8367383557927ec
#. default-sha256: f992a4a94028563d4ea98f8232c47d420a59b0e03f2f678fd91fbd9c010f784b
msgctxt "scenario3:scenario3_3F9E8416_8158_49CE_B53C_3ABD9A69FB6A"
msgid ""
"⟪k:0⟫I first met Jacopo here, in this country.⟪k:1⟫⟪k:2⟫We didn’t even know what the other looked "
"like until our wedding day."
msgstr ""
"⟪k:0⟫J’ai rencontré Jacopo pour la première fois ici, dans ce pays.⟪k:1⟫⟪k:2⟫On ne savait même "
"pas à quoi ressemblait l’autre jusqu’à notre mariage."

#: scenario3:scenario3_EC6CE469_9E0E_4596_B092_7CE515148639
#. Edit msgstr; keep protected ⟪k:N⟫ markers in source order.
#. native-sha256: f2f91a24f28073ca0e945f8db163786ad31c698468a02f58d5660cba6e019323
#. default-sha256: 4e087aa4d484d40883793a5dc426f72fbe55005d97dfeba075b6b91c1d32f11d
msgctxt "scenario3:scenario3_EC6CE469_9E0E_4596_B092_7CE515148639"
msgid ""
"⟪k:0⟫To be quite honest, I was scared to death at first.⟪k:1⟫⟪k:2⟫I was so nervous. What kind of "
"man would he be?⟪k:3⟫⟪k:4⟫Was I to be wed to some middle-aged stranger?"
msgstr ""
"⟪k:0⟫Pour être honnête, j’étais morte de peur, au début.⟪k:1⟫⟪k:2⟫J’étais si nerveuse. Quel genre "
"d’homme serait-il ?⟪k:3⟫⟪k:4⟫Allais-je être mariée à un étranger d’âge moyen ?"

#: scenario3:scenario3_57B4CD43_0996_4BFA_93C0_65EA9CA4E18A
#. Edit msgstr; keep protected ⟪k:N⟫ markers in source order.
#. native-sha256: 003c84d27099871405306c8acfd521238b85b061ce6341e8e52b70e984f6c338
#. default-sha256: a590a5e9ef6ba6d367976e84509136d2b85be77e6531e52ae7675aa0dc195551
msgctxt "scenario3:scenario3_57B4CD43_0996_4BFA_93C0_65EA9CA4E18A"
msgid "⟪k:0⟫We were not marrying because we had fallen in love like a normal couple."
msgstr "⟪k:0⟫On ne se mariait pas parce qu’on était tombé amoureux comme un couple normal."

#: scenario3:scenario3_736DA51F_F6C1_4E3A_A414_D9879E31B034
#. Edit msgstr; keep protected ⟪k:N⟫ markers in source order.
#. native-sha256: b962349b2dcb1e45d5e1d38b760d961a9c16aef78da777f0473852619bfd8cf4
#. default-sha256: 99f78311dc1f7c4da8e15f9d1ca6df44bdcdd23757cfc263f60fa146dcc4ecb2
msgctxt "scenario3:scenario3_736DA51F_F6C1_4E3A_A414_D9879E31B034"
msgid ""
"⟪k:0⟫I knew I was in no position to be concerned with such things,⟪k:1⟫but when I thought about "
"our future, I shook with fear."
msgstr ""
"⟪k:0⟫Je savais que je n’étais pas en position de me soucier de ce genre de choses, mais quand je "
"pensais à notre avenir, je tremblais de peur."

#: scenario3:scenario3_DA9DA23A_2141_4983_AE01_EE5D3C61858A
#. Edit msgstr; keep protected ⟪k:N⟫ markers in source order.
#. native-sha256: 10c3a4037e4237fe946335adaa64895cedc6f75ce05b7a9fe35311bbd09bb7bd
#. default-sha256: 0dc0d7de6d0f2a482bc977b5232daaa281c99d856ce2aa0b7a9c6a2c2f284dff
msgctxt "scenario3:scenario3_DA9DA23A_2141_4983_AE01_EE5D3C61858A"
msgid "⟪k:0⟫But the man I saw through my veil at the wedding was remarkable."
msgstr "⟪k:0⟫Mais l’homme que je vis à travers mon voile au mariage était remarquable."

#: scenario3:scenario3_41F047EC_6FF2_4718_A8B2_2212EB7E4302
#. Edit msgstr; keep protected ⟪k:N⟫ markers in source order.
#. native-sha256: a8a7347cdb08edc8d72f5f26f5bfb0b71005bd6dc9ec9ed7ae48ec7bc926d4e8
#. default-sha256: d80347665441038f8cb45b1b6ea32e8f3ac3c4b2e3d18a5770ebc3d9a92a24cd
msgctxt "scenario3:scenario3_41F047EC_6FF2_4718_A8B2_2212EB7E4302"
msgid ""
"⟪k:0⟫He was young, had strong, masculine eyes,⟪k:1⟫and at the same time, he too appeared nervous."
msgstr ""
"⟪k:0⟫Il était jeune, avait des yeux vifs et virils,⟪k:1⟫et en même temps, lui aussi semblait "
"nerveux."

#: scenario3:scenario3_15C24639_C5DE_457E_A063_7A017E7B0AB7
#. Edit msgstr; keep protected ⟪k:N⟫ markers in source order.
#. native-sha256: 4be46e6f5d0aa45d3518898697eae1637ec89cfb760f04a62a13e23cccfeea51
#. default-sha256: e3e5a5d22e5a39afd56ef1f12192d36a6aae9bfc368c68858702a37f1627cfbb
msgctxt "scenario3:scenario3_15C24639_C5DE_457E_A063_7A017E7B0AB7"
msgid "⟪k:0⟫Hehe... ⟪k:1⟫He was shaking as much—⟪k:2⟫⟪k:3⟫no, even more than me."
msgstr "⟪k:0⟫Héhé... ⟪k:1⟫Il tremblait autant—⟪k:2⟫⟪k:3⟫ non, même plus que moi."

#: scenario3:scenario3_84835AAC_2787_4917_BED2_E2CF58959E44
#. Edit msgstr; keep protected ⟪k:N⟫ markers in source order.
#. native-sha256: da0a38c6e3b4388d158ea3b98b25dc7bb5b2c2b5f2cc24608af2a3a1f87f1279
#. default-sha256: 58a15144cec4b5890e5a52c3f663040573cea05a7288806f075c991353a47f69
msgctxt "scenario3:scenario3_84835AAC_2787_4917_BED2_E2CF58959E44"
msgid ""
"⟪k:0⟫Seeing that, the priest gave an impish little smirk when he asked Jacopo if he vowed his "
"eternal love to me."
msgstr ""
"⟪k:0⟫En voyant cela, le prêtre eut un petit sourire malicieux lorsqu’il demanda à Jacopo s’il me "
"jurait un amour éternel."

#: scenario3:scenario3_74AF65CC_87AB_4374_9A1B_21EAA1FFC794
#. Edit msgstr; keep protected ⟪k:N⟫ markers in source order.
#. native-sha256: 8ab933f40c137b24cdbc261a06b4e00eea294384b8465a68ba9bcd61d880e8cb
#. default-sha256: 820f3409d1f9c2c11a2f89eb0cc62c91c659ca89c8b31401357de9bc5439ff30
msgctxt "scenario3:scenario3_74AF65CC_87AB_4374_9A1B_21EAA1FFC794"
msgid ""
"⟪k:0⟫I... ⟪k:1⟫counted myself among the happy. ⟪k:2⟫And I still do.⟪k:3⟫⟪k:4⟫For in that moment, "
"I experienced true love."
msgstr ""
"⟪k:0⟫Je... ⟪k:1⟫me comptais parmi les chanceuses. ⟪k:2⟫Et c’est toujours le cas.⟪k:3⟫⟪k:4⟫Car à "
"ce moment-là, j’ai fait l’expérience du vrai amour."

#: scenario3:scenario3_23632B1E_62F8_4ED5_B3D8_9FC3A4A6F783
#. Edit msgstr; keep protected ⟪k:N⟫ markers in source order.
#. native-sha256: 65d32a5386f40e26bd8a849f3dee027554edcde7cc7dda57b78b631c4ae22f73
#. default-sha256: 426b26c87e157df34165648c19e9db30ea31f36943b0ab2818e7499c57e095b0
msgctxt "scenario3:scenario3_23632B1E_62F8_4ED5_B3D8_9FC3A4A6F783"
msgid ""
"⟪k:0⟫...You wanted to hear about when he was kind to me?⟪k:1⟫⟪k:2⟫Well, after the wedding, we "
"were given a week to ourselves."
msgstr ""
"⟪k:0⟫...Vous vouliez savoir quand il avait été gentil avec moi ?⟪k:1⟫⟪k:2⟫Eh bien, après le "
"mariage, on nous a donné une semaine à deux."

#: scenario3:scenario3_FD31C664_E284_4A4B_82AA_884CB3236C8A
#. Edit msgstr; keep protected ⟪k:N⟫ markers in source order.
#. native-sha256: d8ba33870fd55e789b2f2f1aa23e2abed6d0c4e14ca4d66b7397dbbe5475837b
#. default-sha256: a7a62e3cf31887db87206b140b6edd28e1e41977f2fd0c3f01688ad7df83b666
msgctxt "scenario3:scenario3_FD31C664_E284_4A4B_82AA_884CB3236C8A"
msgid ""
"⟪k:0⟫I suppose you could call it a honeymoon, though we didn’t take a trip overseas—⟪k:1⟫⟪k:2⟫or "
"even go very far at all."
msgstr ""
"⟪k:0⟫Je suppose qu’on pourrait appeler cela une lune de miel, même si nous n’avons pas voyagé par-"
"delà les mers—⟪k:1⟫⟪k:2⟫ ou même voyagé tout court."

#: scenario3:scenario3_C3545ABA_5D3E_4590_BE8E_3ADF12576978
#. Edit msgstr; keep protected ⟪k:N⟫ markers in source order.
#. native-sha256: 0d376e9fa1f7e998af06500eab3e19436f21aa1ff85c120a06fe3a2a0ec69381
#. default-sha256: cc0505d32b6903281fdc507fbee24f1b3d48d5c92d4b2741bd8b2d9693a888eb
msgctxt "scenario3:scenario3_C3545ABA_5D3E_4590_BE8E_3ADF12576978"
msgid "⟪k:0⟫He looked at me with uncertainty and asked:"
msgstr "⟪k:0⟫Il m’a regardée, incertain, et m’a demandé :"

#: scenario3:scenario3_8D48F148_7278_46E4_8DF7_4D8AACB4C7D1
#. Edit msgstr; keep protected ⟪k:N⟫ markers in source order.
#. native-sha256: da8e22e43528148fe1a06c834303cf15821cf741bbee184f678937ad54e6f686
#. default-sha256: 6976e0097c609bb962ab90fcfa038a056ee0a2ca8e7d2df2a0e95ed626bce76e
msgctxt "scenario3:scenario3_8D48F148_7278_46E4_8DF7_4D8AACB4C7D1"
