msgid ""
"⟪k:0⟫⟪k:1⟫⟪k:2⟫⟪k:3⟫⟪k:4⟫⟪k:5⟫He hurriedly climbed into the carriage he had called for, a look of "
"frustrated displeasure on his face."
msgstr ""
"⟪k:0⟫⟪k:1⟫⟪k:2⟫⟪k:3⟫⟪k:4⟫⟪k:5⟫Il se dépêcha de monter dans la calèche qu’il avait appelée, un air "
"de mécontentement renfrogné sur le visage."

#: scenario3:scenario3_0188FDA6_E178_40AB_9137_0037D28147C0
#. Edit msgstr; keep protected ⟪k:N⟫ markers in source order.
#. native-sha256: 3cfc2300efb887e488a41f9ed2a4db809d85d50e0be0b5ee41597adacb661195
#. default-sha256: 8a0e73af328a6059da25531bac20490fdc2679b04aad45e9774600b08331ed89
msgctxt "scenario3:scenario3_0188FDA6_E178_40AB_9137_0037D28147C0"
msgid ""
"⟪k:0⟫And then, as if he had forgotten about me until that moment,⟪k:1⟫he returned, grabbed me by "
"the arm, and led me to the carriage.⟪k:2⟫⟪k:3⟫In retrospect, I realize he was not being very "
"gentlemanly."
msgstr ""
"⟪k:0⟫Et puis, comme s’il m’avait oubliée jusqu’à ce moment,⟪k:1⟫il se retourna, me prit le bras "
"et me mena à la calèche.⟪k:2⟫⟪k:3⟫Rétrospectivement, je me rends compte que ce n’était pas un "
"vrai gentleman."

#: scenario3:scenario3_C30CAAF0_A587_4AFF_A995_99B62A48DEAD
#. Edit msgstr; keep protected ⟪k:N⟫ markers in source order.
#. native-sha256: 3c547b49326ce547a39b4eebdba30c743f5591d702e203405bfd89c6df556f90
#. default-sha256: a7dd2ddd57f819165375ea86496b3b9e771e95d8b7c72c33ac493b3c7b9b979a
msgctxt "scenario3:scenario3_C30CAAF0_A587_4AFF_A995_99B62A48DEAD"
msgid "⟪k:0⟫But I was pleased that he was making any attempt to interact with me at all."
msgstr "⟪k:0⟫Mais j’étais contente de voir qu’il faisait des efforts pour interagir avec moi."

#: scenario3:scenario3_81975920_F28C_42F2_A838_235574DC5766
#. Edit msgstr; keep protected ⟪k:N⟫ markers in source order.
#. native-sha256: 60d3d6ddacf865ba375c2e17a80e37fde956f704ffecc5a5bdc116dc253c9159
#. default-sha256: aad370da2830db8e7e50513055c96a9344134affc2a05a5ac347b2cf97196ed4
msgctxt "scenario3:scenario3_81975920_F28C_42F2_A838_235574DC5766"
msgid ""
"⟪k:0⟫⟪k:1⟫⟪k:2⟫⟪k:3⟫As the carriage trotted down the streets, I saw so many new things. ⟪k:4⟫I "
"had spent most of my time cooped up inside at home, so it was like stepping into an entirely new "
"world."
msgstr ""
"⟪k:0⟫⟪k:1⟫⟪k:2⟫⟪k:3⟫Alors que la calèche trottait dans les rues, je voyais tant de nouvelles "
"choses. ⟪k:4⟫J’avais passé la majeure partie de mon existence cloîtrée à la maison, alors j’avais "
"l’impression de poser les pieds dans un monde entièrement nouveau."

#: scenario3:scenario3_F7E471AF_39FD_4DD6_BA3D_5E4AFD9F4448
#. Edit msgstr; keep protected ⟪k:N⟫ markers in source order.
#. native-sha256: 9125989a26e333be72f3b5eb47687776a944eb5528db7d9e0c1970cb09411b3d
#. default-sha256: bf64422deaeb1785e7f7cc6d5683e00163a7bca0b8df55deb1699c7eaa2b9bb5
msgctxt "scenario3:scenario3_F7E471AF_39FD_4DD6_BA3D_5E4AFD9F4448"
msgid ""
"⟪k:0⟫And add to that the rapid industrial advancement currently taking place. I saw men shouting "
"back and forth as they smacked newspaper articles with the backs of their hands."
msgstr ""
"⟪k:0⟫Ajoutez à cela le rapide progrès industriel qui s’installait. J’apercevais des hommes qui se "
"parlaient en criant et en tapant du dos de la main les articles de journal."

#: scenario3:scenario3_ACA8EC42_591F_41E2_8D16_DA7FC376D6C1
#. Edit msgstr; keep protected ⟪k:N⟫ markers in source order.
#. native-sha256: 9e10ca3650a1237f75284f4e198552e4c1129232a9bcc8f1febc1572236b0ddc
#. default-sha256: fd528007a4ede8c9f86dc16ded71b9af1786922a1de05d8b5431ed8f952dbad3
msgctxt "scenario3:scenario3_ACA8EC42_591F_41E2_8D16_DA7FC376D6C1"
msgid "⟪k:0⟫I saw corner cafés crowded with cigar-smoking men on break from work."
msgstr ""
"⟪k:0⟫Je voyais des cafés au coin de la rue où se bousculaient des hommes qui fumaient le cigare "
"pendant leur pause."

#: scenario3:scenario3_3E770804_C359_4AD0_9005_C149A830FD99
#. Edit msgstr; keep protected ⟪k:N⟫ markers in source order.
#. native-sha256: 33473d6ca857598c9cd6773ec38a4df261d252bc0d2f3a9994199771481df64c
