msgctxt "scenario3:scenario3_3E770804_C359_4AD0_9005_C149A830FD99"
msgid "⟪k:0⟫It was like the hustle and bustle of a festival."
msgstr "⟪k:0⟫C’était l’animation d’un festival."

#: scenario3:scenario3_09F1954E_E863_48A3_AB29_810051BD9AC9
#. Edit msgstr; keep protected ⟪k:N⟫ markers in source order.
#. native-sha256: c0b5ba1fb42356e0671b9e5a878c7d2ba461231ec8a3c54d10829fbbcf01f109
#. default-sha256: 1910b38a5a90ba236f9f546de16f69abf143405e5448c069e4b070be6f159607
msgctxt "scenario3:scenario3_09F1954E_E863_48A3_AB29_810051BD9AC9"
msgid ""
"⟪k:0⟫But every festival has its underside.⟪k:1⟫⟪k:2⟫I also saw overworked men, looking like they "
"were on the verge of collapse, drinking water from a spigot on the side of the road."
msgstr ""
"⟪k:0⟫Mais chaque festival a ses dessous.⟪k:1⟫⟪k:2⟫Je voyais aussi des hommes surchargés de "
"travail qui avaient l’air d’être sur le point de s’écrouler et qui buvaient l’eau du robinet au "
"bord de la route."

#: scenario3:scenario3_81720A2E_E9C4_42AD_8CE4_1F595F4C433A
#. Edit msgstr; keep protected ⟪k:N⟫ markers in source order.
#. native-sha256: 7bc1275d23576b139e572d37fbe14a55e1833b0b059a1ac1d8d46c2853063b22
#. default-sha256: 9391e686f783000124a947492189680e69318f14d8c719f17cf49e5c34dbf3dc
msgctxt "scenario3:scenario3_81720A2E_E9C4_42AD_8CE4_1F595F4C433A"
msgid "⟪k:0⟫By way of contrast, I wore fine clothing and had a carriage at my disposal."
msgstr ""
"⟪k:0⟫Par contraste, moi, je portais de beaux vêtements et j’avais une calèche à ma disposition."

#: scenario3:scenario3_26A919A1_89F1_4143_8922_218DC4FC45E4
#. Edit msgstr; keep protected ⟪k:N⟫ markers in source order.
#. native-sha256: 4c8b13dfe01223281bc072850045610e23d92badb70748d17a7bb04b009b1998
