msgctxt "scenario3:scenario3_26A919A1_89F1_4143_8922_218DC4FC45E4"
msgid "⟪k:0⟫I imagine every day was a struggle for them just to remain afloat."
msgstr ""
"⟪k:0⟫J’imagine que chaque jour était pour eux une épreuve, ne serait-ce que pour garder la tête "
"hors de l’eau."

#: scenario3:scenario3_DC0B0531_15BA_4CEB_862A_21A6FAF15CBC
#. Edit msgstr; keep protected ⟪k:N⟫ markers in source order.
#. native-sha256: 4cdb4311f5811f88ba492986d6971b779bb82b5e6cf27984b7818c78cacccfe9
#. default-sha256: 6df0f579843a059ec863bda4b2586079610933429c404701c8ca989281d07017
msgctxt "scenario3:scenario3_DC0B0531_15BA_4CEB_862A_21A6FAF15CBC"
msgid ""
"⟪k:0⟫Had I not married the man I had, I too might have found myself on the streets in a similar "
"situation."
msgstr ""
"⟪k:0⟫Si je n’avais pas épousé cet homme, je me serais peut-être moi aussi retrouvée dans la même "
"situation."

#: scenario3:scenario3_F4922A8A_F0C8_45C0_8543_304E7803862E
#. Edit msgstr; keep protected ⟪k:N⟫ markers in source order.
#. native-sha256: 8d7768cb6af50afb0ba3e4e028e07fee04b960da3748d6d6ce202267fafd4695
#. default-sha256: 5f64090ed82dcd30092d66c219afa852503dd170f1bd3a919f74312d034f6278
msgctxt "scenario3:scenario3_F4922A8A_F0C8_45C0_8543_304E7803862E"
msgid ""
"⟪k:0⟫But it was not relief that spread through my breast at the sight of them—⟪k:1⟫⟪k:2⟫it was "
"pangs of guilt."
msgstr ""
"⟪k:0⟫Mais ce n’était pas le soulagement qui se répandait dans mon cœur lorsque je les voyais—⟪k:1⟫"
"⟪k:2⟫ plutôt une pointe de culpabilité."

#: scenario3:scenario3_52700419_9AB1_4915_AD52_69907D07B46C
#. Edit msgstr; keep protected ⟪k:N⟫ markers in source order.
#. native-sha256: ed76f1c0bdff163b5612287f2d9037b9f575019cd7947f13a4d621c4db4b3ad7
#. default-sha256: 9a611fdf8682234316c837471c218bdce91c83d450b5e29b36d848685d7ce28f
msgctxt "scenario3:scenario3_52700419_9AB1_4915_AD52_69907D07B46C"
msgid "⟪k:0⟫It felt to me like a life of opulence was wrong—⟪k:1⟫⟪k:2⟫sinful."
msgstr "⟪k:0⟫J’avais l’impression qu’une vie d’opulence était un mal—⟪k:1⟫⟪k:2⟫ un péché."

#: scenario3:scenario3_163C0426_05C8_426E_B539_128F3806B452
#. Edit msgstr; keep protected ⟪k:N⟫ markers in source order.
#. native-sha256: 802c5f031cf44ab35dffbc1cc78316f69390a961c28d19d31e45cc065b870076
#. default-sha256: 4bf237cb5570f0d7d9901b0fd339212e4e62ede487ef942a3f940228b6d4368d
msgctxt "scenario3:scenario3_163C0426_05C8_426E_B539_128F3806B452"
msgid "⟪k:0⟫It broke my heart to know that I was living so much better than them."
msgstr "⟪k:0⟫Cela me brisait le cœur, de savoir que je vivais bien mieux qu’eux."

#: scenario3:scenario3_A783A18D_AFF5_4E09_BD0A_ED9C67F7EE03
#. Edit msgstr; keep protected ⟪k:N⟫ markers in source order.
#. native-sha256: 27ed906f5720646636bfe2e1b4a22ca966ebbea831b47c26cc27d4dbbc0bbb24
#. default-sha256: 454534e024220ab630118d11456a0b784a83436cf80ff08ce289df634394679e
msgctxt "scenario3:scenario3_A783A18D_AFF5_4E09_BD0A_ED9C67F7EE03"
msgid "⟪k:0⟫Jacopo snorted disapprovingly at me,⟪k:1⟫seemingly reading my mind, and then said,"
msgstr "⟪k:0⟫Jacopo renifla dédaigneusement,⟪k:1⟫et comme s’il lisait dans mon esprit, me dit :"

#: scenario3:scenario3_B9EF10F3_F029_4FA1_B685_919660CA249B
#. Edit msgstr; keep protected ⟪k:N⟫ markers in source order.
#. native-sha256: b18c9a9ef36695963ced8ec8fa737e4304a1c9e11a75c2544beb3947c2fd0629
#. default-sha256: e1a397b0acab90b361e1533cfdd18abd0cbae71461761d477f05fcd078acd450
msgctxt "scenario3:scenario3_B9EF10F3_F029_4FA1_B685_919660CA249B"
msgid ""
"⟪k:0⟫The poor man who envies the rich, covets his wealth, and finds the ambition to make the same "
"for himself; and the rich man who pities the poor, thinking it his duty to give them offerings of "
"philanthropy."
msgstr ""
"⟪k:0⟫L’homme pauvre jalouse le riche, convoite sa richesse et trouve l’ambition de se hausser au-"
"dessus de sa condition ; et l’homme riche plaint le pauvre et pense qu’il en va de son devoir de "
"lui porter assistance."

#: scenario3:scenario3_DC0D11EF_97EB_4AF4_BBDF_E766FA189913
#. Edit msgstr; keep protected ⟪k:N⟫ markers in source order.
#. native-sha256: 4884f5c06a09ba269fe877a94bf198464ace66db7a4ee3fbc389e787c924ec92
#. default-sha256: 2156e8eece8bce64e7c0a06adf28be172d6bef88aa14145bfa628bb1563bffd1
msgctxt "scenario3:scenario3_DC0D11EF_97EB_4AF4_BBDF_E766FA189913"
msgid ""
"⟪k:0⟫To me, the latter is the far more nefarious.⟪k:1⟫⟪k:2⟫Excessive charity will ruin a man—⟪k:3⟫"
"⟪k:4⟫make him come to ⟪k:5⟫expect⟪k:6⟫ handouts."
msgstr ""
"⟪k:0⟫Pour moi, ce dernier est bien plus néfaste.⟪k:1⟫⟪k:2⟫Une charité excessive peut ruiner un "
"homme—⟪k:3⟫⟪k:4⟫ le pousser à mendier davantage."

#: scenario3:scenario3_7580BB79_0880_4B00_B09A_5AB66A50A862
#. Edit msgstr; keep protected ⟪k:N⟫ markers in source order.
#. native-sha256: 94f92e681fcccc44ff0c6d8e169c1bf52f9677982ca87342762c1331ca5272e1
#. default-sha256: e3b0e3635949c4a228390c32fb883219a00365fdd1883f7fabfc65283b23a2f4
msgctxt "scenario3:scenario3_7580BB79_0880_4B00_B09A_5AB66A50A862"
msgid ""
"⟪k:0⟫And then there are those with the wrong idea of pity,⟪k:1⟫who let themselves fall down to "
"the same place,⟪k:2⟫mistakenly believing it will somehow make the poor feel better."
msgstr ""
"⟪k:0⟫Et puis, il y a ceux qui se trompent de pitié,⟪k:1⟫qui se laissent tomber dans le malheur,"
"⟪k:2⟫en croyant à tort que ça aidera les pauvres à aller mieux."

#: scenario3:scenario3_B458156B_E124_44F7_ADB2_465039BD8E86
#. Edit msgstr; keep protected ⟪k:N⟫ markers in source order.
#. native-sha256: 203436186a9e3624efa5491152a92e729669c1589a97cd866e597206a39ab48e
#. default-sha256: 989afd223e8aa62a0b9b1b90587a6dc0b7db0afbc73db53031bafcc2f80bed81
msgctxt "scenario3:scenario3_B458156B_E124_44F7_ADB2_465039BD8E86"
msgid ""
"⟪k:0⟫What a joke.⟪k:1⟫⟪k:2⟫If you’re going to do anything for them,⟪k:3⟫you might as well "
"encourage them to climb upward.⟪k:4⟫⟪k:5⟫Spur on economic growth and the flow of capital."
msgstr ""
"⟪k:0⟫Quelle blague.⟪k:1⟫⟪k:2⟫Si vous voulez faire quelque chose pour eux,⟪k:3⟫vous feriez aussi "
"bien de les encourager à grimper l’échelle sociale.⟪k:4⟫⟪k:5⟫Les mener vers la croissance "
"économique et le flux du capital."

#: scenario3:scenario3_D6F4E7EC_444F_45AA_AADE_3440E0DC6019
#. Edit msgstr; keep protected ⟪k:N⟫ markers in source order.
#. native-sha256: 8bebd179bd1ce76074a33719545909828af12db38f8601451698331c1b61b0e4
#. default-sha256: 074754a1d05f20379a6d37bd7207de2581135f1f14f376501bb4b2965397d991
msgctxt "scenario3:scenario3_D6F4E7EC_444F_45AA_AADE_3440E0DC6019"
msgid "⟪k:0⟫Doesn’t that sound like the better option?"
msgstr "⟪k:0⟫N’est-ce pas la meilleure solution ?"

#: scenario3:scenario3_6EC44BC1_4A4E_4836_B550_52ACE5E7DF2D
#. Edit msgstr; keep protected ⟪k:N⟫ markers in source order.
#. native-sha256: 4c288246567a58879dda80d1d6309c7600ae0f5584bc1f7e4add971501eb5ed8
#. default-sha256: a95f60f26cc2072caa7d7178f51435596647f84b733c05a6c3f836e8a6cd09e2
msgctxt "scenario3:scenario3_6EC44BC1_4A4E_4836_B550_52ACE5E7DF2D"
msgid "⟪k:0⟫I say nothing, simply smiling and giving an ambiguous nod."
msgstr "⟪k:0⟫Je ne dis rien, souriant simplement et hochant légèrement de la tête."

#: scenario3:scenario3_F7805F0B_400E_4C2A_9E7E_9C63E47B4F9C
#. Edit msgstr; keep protected ⟪k:N⟫ markers in source order.
#. native-sha256: 8aee2fefe96bd74b8446187934027cae5f7c3808750bcc0fda1df0de907334fd
#. default-sha256: a9cd64303b5d9486aff03df760596f21a0d7e76fa7cf0012dd3f7c62841bb233
msgctxt "scenario3:scenario3_F7805F0B_400E_4C2A_9E7E_9C63E47B4F9C"
msgid ""
"⟪k:0⟫He had a point—⟪k:1⟫⟪k:2⟫my sympathy and guilt meant nothing to people actually experiencing "
"hardship."
msgstr ""
"⟪k:0⟫Il marquait un point—⟪k:1⟫⟪k:2⟫ ma sympathie et ma culpabilité ne signifiaient rien pour les "
"gens qui traversaient des épreuves."

#: scenario3:scenario3_57AC9D4E_7833_4FB3_BD10_8C8973D388E3
#. Edit msgstr; keep protected ⟪k:N⟫ markers in source order.
#. native-sha256: 5556d4363cf2c32a5b3516392cfc447e58ec9d69b70dc4bcced21850eb335d78
#. default-sha256: 347599a7b0dfa810448b948dfdde79e9657d354af0cb3d78426ec9c7d725a902
msgctxt "scenario3:scenario3_57AC9D4E_7833_4FB3_BD10_8C8973D388E3"
msgid ""
"⟪k:0⟫If, feeling guilty of my own fortune, I acted upon that pity in the way he had described, it "
"would accomplish little more than self-satisfaction."
msgstr ""
"⟪k:0⟫Si, en me sentant coupable de ma propre fortune, j’agissais comme il venait de le décrire, "
"je n’aurais accompli guère plus qu’un acte d’auto-satisfaction."

#: scenario3:scenario3_0AE4D07C_52F0_49A1_AF90_1B33580AC416
#. Edit msgstr; keep protected ⟪k:N⟫ markers in source order.
#. native-sha256: 3fe9e2d96005dc2381baf12d35334e9797243eaef21fa9ef958b5e22413bd598
#. default-sha256: 60497c7f81f7a10bd972e2283a1a26068256e2e216e9be38d151939687e00eb0
msgctxt "scenario3:scenario3_0AE4D07C_52F0_49A1_AF90_1B33580AC416"
msgid "⟪k:0⟫He seemed to have seen straight through to my very core."
msgstr "⟪k:0⟫Il semblait avoir lu en moi."

#: scenario3:scenario3_338A214B_4F06_4322_9C63_D42884C88DEF
#. Edit msgstr; keep protected ⟪k:N⟫ markers in source order.
#. native-sha256: 73c4d0a8518f2069ab64e1cb5b64176df87bc8373a6eed1b86ca2fc39302746a
#. default-sha256: b6d97fc0ba6fdfff377d62d0583f04fa24e96d3290787fffc890db5945509d0a
msgctxt "scenario3:scenario3_338A214B_4F06_4322_9C63_D42884C88DEF"
msgid ""
"⟪k:0⟫This was a man who had built his own fortune through investment, which I imagine required "
"him to be rather astute."
msgstr ""
"⟪k:0⟫C’était un homme qui avait construit sa fortune par l’investissement, ce qui signifiait, à "
"mon sens, qu’il était assez malin."

#: scenario3:scenario3_F0325961_F8F1_4CD8_AA01_5263343BCEB2
#. Edit msgstr; keep protected ⟪k:N⟫ markers in source order.
#. native-sha256: 0d661dc25f5ac3ec80cab8571fbcd33473fc34f5720c98519959b820752eacc7
#. default-sha256: ec436c74c608fe8b5af101b7c21fef4076ee968bb9c3812367c31f12adb23a30
msgctxt "scenario3:scenario3_F0325961_F8F1_4CD8_AA01_5263343BCEB2"
msgid ""
"⟪k:0⟫But doesn’t a world where everyone is constantly trying to climb higher and higher sound "
"rather... ⟪k:1⟫⟪k:2⟫exhausting?"
msgstr ""
"⟪k:0⟫Mais est-ce qu’un monde où tout le monde ne cesse constamment de grimper plus haut et encore "
"plus haut n’est pas... ⟪k:1⟫⟪k:2⟫épuisant ?"

#: scenario3:scenario3_2E910B1B_0FDE_4326_A041_49C2890B066B
#. Edit msgstr; keep protected ⟪k:N⟫ markers in source order.
#. native-sha256: 71d8130ef599b49a2459da37ae575c2bbedd856a1ccf8a3bd414e3be22488191
#. default-sha256: 885f1fe7dfe70c6b4cf345497dd53f2f652c757e2e544e2ea045c6245af29a91
msgctxt "scenario3:scenario3_2E910B1B_0FDE_4326_A041_49C2890B066B"
msgid ""
"⟪k:0⟫I, personally, would prefer to be in a position where I could watch—⟪k:1⟫⟪k:2⟫if only from a "
"distance—⟪k:3⟫⟪k:4⟫as others climbed."
msgstr ""
"⟪k:0⟫Personnellement, je préférerais être dans la position d’un spectateur —⟪k:1⟫⟪k:2⟫ même si "
"c’est de loin —⟪k:3⟫⟪k:4⟫ et regarder les autres faire l’ascension."

#: scenario3:scenario3_DFC0CC61_2D5D_40C2_A766_B58A603DD386
#. Edit msgstr; keep protected ⟪k:N⟫ markers in source order.
#. native-sha256: a9470a7e88c0a5139c7790bc570c32ef6abcf9cac4ba3802b1b67ba1c6b289a1
#. default-sha256: 94dcf94d18a2f178b2231f241888f76362eb7567ec353346c42a3d64f97683ea
msgctxt "scenario3:scenario3_DFC0CC61_2D5D_40C2_A766_B58A603DD386"
msgid "⟪k:0⟫But obviously, I could not say as much to him."
msgstr "⟪k:0⟫Mais de toute évidence, je ne pouvais lui faire part de mes pensées."

#: scenario3:scenario3_EB5E04E7_26DF_4498_AA3D_BF948827CA0F
#. Edit msgstr; keep protected ⟪k:N⟫ markers in source order.
#. native-sha256: d7468c8ffc5a3683a13d999d4a547395bd5b2fd8558c86da2c170d88f9284535
#. default-sha256: 29430caab3a0618152686073f5b1def1693a281174cf3528fad350cc93b69499
msgctxt "scenario3:scenario3_EB5E04E7_26DF_4498_AA3D_BF948827CA0F"
msgid "⟪k:0⟫⟪k:1⟫⟪k:2⟫⟪k:3⟫Some time later, the carriage came to a stop in front of a shop."
msgstr "⟪k:0⟫⟪k:1⟫⟪k:2⟫⟪k:3⟫Un peu plus tard, la calèche s’arrêta devant une boutique."

#: scenario3:scenario3_9BBEABC7_9248_4DD0_B475_4022BDF38225
#. Edit msgstr; keep protected ⟪k:N⟫ markers in source order.
#. native-sha256: 29ef821b358bd95d5ee281401caf4c7dcff90113af1652c11ef11d8737e02551
#. default-sha256: a36608ebf711bd5962ec265297223ede52d63020e7b918156cda461c13050dd6
msgctxt "scenario3:scenario3_9BBEABC7_9248_4DD0_B475_4022BDF38225"
msgid ""
"⟪k:0⟫As I looked at the building perplexedly, he gestured to the door with his chin, signaling "
"for me to get out."
msgstr ""
"⟪k:0⟫Tandis que je regardais le bâtiment avec perplexité, il m’indiqua du menton la porte et me "
"fit comprendre que l’on descendait ici."

#: scenario3:scenario3_5F2E2CD1_5675_47B5_88A9_30D721AC5D8B
#. Edit msgstr; keep protected ⟪k:N⟫ markers in source order.
#. native-sha256: 0ba5f635e1dbd2dba82634b97ba1fe92ba56009e101650464bf132d49755b1b3
#. default-sha256: b78212287f206e9a71fd5b459dc352b8074caffcf85bbd37f262292a92912795
msgctxt "scenario3:scenario3_5F2E2CD1_5675_47B5_88A9_30D721AC5D8B"
msgid ""
"⟪k:0⟫Lost and confused, I stepped down from the carriage,⟪k:1⟫and before me spread a showcase "
"behind a large glass window."
msgstr ""
"⟪k:0⟫Je sortis de la calèche, perdue et désorientée ;⟪k:1⟫devant moi, il y avait une large "
"fenêtre en verre qui affichait la vitrine de la boutique."

#: scenario3:scenario3_8FA62325_56EE_4756_B4ED_B3B1168F68DA
#. Edit msgstr; keep protected ⟪k:N⟫ markers in source order.
#. native-sha256: ebb11d44a686bb7ae4e9d97d9451a11ccdbe667efc540ca4cdeaac1a3a90aca7
#. default-sha256: 220aa6eac6b10a7a1df6663818e0bd9dae515b15c83360c9fd1ebef6b35549e0
msgctxt "scenario3:scenario3_8FA62325_56EE_4756_B4ED_B3B1168F68DA"
msgid ""
"⟪k:0⟫However, lined up in the case were not precious metals or expensive clothing, ⟪k:1⟫but "
"machines."
msgstr ""
"⟪k:0⟫Mais, alignées sur les étagères, se trouvaient non pas du métal précieux ou des vêtements "
"chers, ⟪k:1⟫mais des machines."

#: scenario3:scenario3_C0B8281B_8022_40D2_9847_71A7F98CAB60
#. Edit msgstr; keep protected ⟪k:N⟫ markers in source order.
#. native-sha256: 453afe5d085a47b6d3b90dd3bd7eb451c44dda040a3c613e0ea25a1a6470c6d2
#. default-sha256: 5b8b57d17013aa587944114d6e8ce621f7da45f75f2b5f4f8d2e0559b27d53b7
msgctxt "scenario3:scenario3_C0B8281B_8022_40D2_9847_71A7F98CAB60"
msgid "⟪k:0⟫At first, I had no idea what kind of devices they were."
msgstr "⟪k:0⟫Au début, je n’avais aucune idée du genre d’appareils qui y était exposé."

#: scenario3:scenario3_8A105800_7BFB_4FAD_A2F3_F81F309E90F6
#. Edit msgstr; keep protected ⟪k:N⟫ markers in source order.
#. native-sha256: d6166221e0c8f9c3980f9be905193d2e6911ebfb70df6901d17c30a67ce7f610
#. default-sha256: a1f3463527c93c285750212552ce0eed775c77ac16814599a23f137e75a3d98e
msgctxt "scenario3:scenario3_8A105800_7BFB_4FAD_A2F3_F81F309E90F6"
msgid "⟪k:0⟫⟪k:1⟫⟪k:2⟫⟪k:3⟫⟪k:4⟫⟪k:5⟫⟪k:6⟫⟪k:7⟫Have you never had your photo taken before?"
msgstr "⟪k:0⟫⟪k:1⟫⟪k:2⟫⟪k:3⟫⟪k:4⟫⟪k:5⟫⟪k:6⟫⟪k:7⟫On ne vous a jamais prise en photo avant ?"

#: scenario3:scenario3_3ACF441F_3E8B_4A94_8048_A1BBE4B15EEE
#. Edit msgstr; keep protected ⟪k:N⟫ markers in source order.
#. native-sha256: a7fbe3e07c62db14e717ed22fc4d1c255d92e61880afebf9a32b49e3316231f2
#. default-sha256: efabd2af329974f75d8e4edb22e3bccd95cbb540c311ec6b5d410e1d1ecdf92f
msgctxt "scenario3:scenario3_3ACF441F_3E8B_4A94_8048_A1BBE4B15EEE"
msgid ""
"⟪k:0⟫⟪k:1⟫N-⟪k:2⟫No. I have had a portrait painted, though...⟪k:3⟫⟪k:4⟫Are these machines for "
"taking photographs?"
msgstr ""
"⟪k:0⟫⟪k:1⟫N-⟪k:2⟫Non. Mais on m’a peint un portrait...⟪k:3⟫⟪k:4⟫Est-ce que ces machines servent à "
"prendre des photographies ?"

#: scenario3:scenario3_44144CC4_05DC_4B1B_8225_6C5DEFDC4A79
#. Edit msgstr; keep protected ⟪k:N⟫ markers in source order.
#. native-sha256: 76cb0055442b4f62c42dbcfb84ab5242f7c9430b83985f4c49be20b70f4cf06b
#. default-sha256: d461d9dcdb4946875e3df608a2c7fbf07202b34d08f45a67a8ade10bdbc37864
msgctxt "scenario3:scenario3_44144CC4_05DC_4B1B_8225_6C5DEFDC4A79"
msgid "⟪k:0⟫⟪k:1⟫A portrait, eh?⟪k:2⟫⟪k:3⟫Why am I not surprised?"
msgstr "⟪k:0⟫⟪k:1⟫Un portrait, hein ?⟪k:2⟫⟪k:3⟫Pourquoi ne suis-je pas surpris ?"

#: scenario3:scenario3_455B22F7_27BC_4453_872D_2409482E44F4
#. Edit msgstr; keep protected ⟪k:N⟫ markers in source order.
#. native-sha256: 801fd3fa3cb46f211cd1e66b3d5655cc63ba9a1c8f742c98c2c0db09296cf1ff
#. default-sha256: e2a3292442ccdf8d538ded59cbdca6a5e91626c1b5a3ea27d9dccf55fb95c22b
msgctxt "scenario3:scenario3_455B22F7_27BC_4453_872D_2409482E44F4"
