msgctxt "scenario3:scenario3_9A0750B8_7526_48A5_B10B_BEC654A660EF"
msgid ""
"⟪k:0⟫⟪k:1⟫⟪k:2⟫⟪k:3⟫Having said that, Jacopo exited the shop. ⟪k:4⟫I alternated between looking "
"at his back and the phenakis wheel, debating what I wanted to do."
msgstr ""
"⟪k:0⟫⟪k:1⟫⟪k:2⟫⟪k:3⟫Sur ces mots, Jacopo sortit de la boutique. ⟪k:4⟫J’hésitais entre le regarder "
"partir ou regarder la roue, ne sachant quoi faire."

#: scenario3:scenario3_9BCEABBE_8021_408C_B45B_5B064B66E68E
#. Edit msgstr; keep protected ⟪k:N⟫ markers in source order.
#. native-sha256: d7e3f3b2d0d5db4c3c8149c522699354248bb54d0063242d2bb58b51c5889bcc
#. default-sha256: 37a9b1da13475f7551aa5bdf8a6a4db8b7b18a80be527e75b8f419b46f965f07
msgctxt "scenario3:scenario3_9BCEABBE_8021_408C_B45B_5B064B66E68E"
msgid "⟪k:0⟫And then, with a smile, the owner whispered to me,"
msgstr "⟪k:0⟫C’est alors que le propriétaire me murmura en souriant :"

#: scenario3:scenario3_308ED643_CBDE_400F_947D_CA819996FB01
#. Edit msgstr; keep protected ⟪k:N⟫ markers in source order.
#. native-sha256: 0f30aebb723b1c8a5f0bb335b13de83ab60abf76ed43f74ebc953d1d5012ca86
#. default-sha256: d456600bea8ecfc56f7659f982fca1fead6e83f4ba65fa9a2f282cbec5e760af
msgctxt "scenario3:scenario3_308ED643_CBDE_400F_947D_CA819996FB01"
msgid ""
"⟪k:0⟫You’re allowed to keep it, really.⟪k:1⟫⟪k:2⟫Your husband out there had it made as a gift for "
"you."
msgstr ""
"⟪k:0⟫Vous pouvez la garder, vraiment.⟪k:1⟫⟪k:2⟫Votre mari avait prévu de vous l’offrir en cadeau."

#: scenario3:scenario3_326BF10D_AAAF_498E_A01D_721A977E61AE
#. Edit msgstr; keep protected ⟪k:N⟫ markers in source order.
#. native-sha256: a8592482e1cb1e681ce9f1f201deffd9344e8649c1697f4c10d7d8580df2e23d
#. default-sha256: 5760b7751810500d66a28d22a7b1dd4c49ac03e0c090d65b9498fb5c40ae3fea
msgctxt "scenario3:scenario3_326BF10D_AAAF_498E_A01D_721A977E61AE"
msgid "⟪k:0⟫⟪k:1⟫For me?"
msgstr "⟪k:0⟫⟪k:1⟫Me l’offrir ?"

#: scenario3:scenario3_8CB29845_CC4F_4532_89F0_35C18F363818
#. Edit msgstr; keep protected ⟪k:N⟫ markers in source order.
#. native-sha256: 450aefd0dfefaea35457a1717ae27c9f2fa64c410ef1b41d7161ac9b388d8261
#. default-sha256: 9a3a5480d8d51e43fa39e10e001e29c9ce936463a771faa657f0cdb48c7f1efc
