msgid ""
"⟪k:0⟫⟪k:1⟫⟪k:2⟫Little while back, he came to my shop asking if I could make a phenakistoscope."
msgstr ""
"⟪k:0⟫⟪k:1⟫⟪k:2⟫Il y a quelques jours, il est venu à ma boutique pour me demander si je pouvais "
"faire un phénakistiscope."

#: scenario3:scenario3_D299A1E5_558D_40C0_AF98_9A8049309BDC
#. Edit msgstr; keep protected ⟪k:N⟫ markers in source order.
#. native-sha256: 9846f3adaef28ec6aded7405b70fa67873212df9fe408519e70963f15ee41cb4
#. default-sha256: 493ce8638e75074173f786c0cd3e38cbbaf0f58c4032776d5062774ffd40989b
msgctxt "scenario3:scenario3_D299A1E5_558D_40C0_AF98_9A8049309BDC"
msgid ""
"⟪k:0⟫Now ⟪k:1⟫that⟪k:2⟫ about knocked me outta my chair!⟪k:3⟫⟪k:4⟫He’s a man who almost never "
"asks for favors."
msgstr ""
"⟪k:0⟫Ça alors, j’ai failli en tomber de ma chaise !⟪k:1⟫⟪k:2⟫C’est un homme qui ne demande "
"presque jamais de service."

#: scenario3:scenario3_B2069696_8198_4892_833E_CF906E7D1034
#. Edit msgstr; keep protected ⟪k:N⟫ markers in source order.
#. native-sha256: d0559f29c14a04c4e51738a54a4853a37e91bd3cefd37f18ac0abdd431809054
#. default-sha256: 2df32c2554f29d2f136f9033bd522eeca5d7be95d7df464131bb9b0bef3767c5
msgctxt "scenario3:scenario3_B2069696_8198_4892_833E_CF906E7D1034"
msgid ""
"⟪k:0⟫He’s pretty damn brusque and he’s got a tongue sharp enough to cut steel, but he’s not "
"wicked to his core—⟪k:1⟫⟪k:2⟫I swear it."
msgstr ""
"⟪k:0⟫Il est sacrément bourru et il a la langue bien affilée mais au fond ce n’est pas un méchant "
"homme—⟪k:1⟫⟪k:2⟫ j’en jurerais."

#: scenario3:scenario3_F7FFBE68_47A9_439F_AA03_4B2F1C3DE410
#. Edit msgstr; keep protected ⟪k:N⟫ markers in source order.
#. native-sha256: 167849577e389f968d93c8e41257af67ed10409b4ba479de781bdf8d32966fb7
#. default-sha256: 29b25e37cb75028e313cd325db6cdea81c78bf1c3da0d462775e01cce6085562
msgctxt "scenario3:scenario3_F7FFBE68_47A9_439F_AA03_4B2F1C3DE410"
msgid "⟪k:0⟫So please, ma’am, be a pillar of support for him."
msgstr "⟪k:0⟫Alors, je vous en prie, madame, prenez bien soin de lui et soutenez-le."

#: scenario3:scenario3_98C292A7_C21E_4D5A_B22F_BBBF6202FDC5
#. Edit msgstr; keep protected ⟪k:N⟫ markers in source order.
#. native-sha256: 507839916ef0e6b17510fc8619c6a60bdc281c30543f559f3fcda1eabe9a5324
#. default-sha256: ed6134da5796226d9c73dd1e7197a88a2e173380eebce60a41a693dad3a11129
msgctxt "scenario3:scenario3_98C292A7_C21E_4D5A_B22F_BBBF6202FDC5"
msgid ""
"⟪k:0⟫⟪k:1⟫⟪k:2⟫⟪k:3⟫⟪k:4⟫In that moment, the phenakis wheel became a precious treasure to me."
msgstr ""
"⟪k:0⟫⟪k:1⟫⟪k:2⟫⟪k:3⟫⟪k:4⟫C’est ainsi que la roue de phénakis devint un de mes trésors les plus "
"précieux."

#: scenario3:scenario3_93B41298_3DF4_48A0_8D07_D1426C701A97
#. Edit msgstr; keep protected ⟪k:N⟫ markers in source order.
#. native-sha256: d3e13dbf52c84a527c0923b0585a2b4c1d89c4b7cbbb457476f98820ec2891aa
#. default-sha256: 6c977feb46be80f1d2b37246b8a1b3942e87d6c480d484c8438045399934b459
msgctxt "scenario3:scenario3_93B41298_3DF4_48A0_8D07_D1426C701A97"
msgid "⟪k:0⟫We had only just married days earlier..."
msgstr "⟪k:0⟫On venait tout juste de se marier quelques jours auparavant..."

#: scenario3:scenario3_AC30B3DE_B94F_4D8D_8073_E6BBF6BCDEC7
#. Edit msgstr; keep protected ⟪k:N⟫ markers in source order.
#. native-sha256: 7d316b296df4c6abaf2e0b2954f6cf63d5e9e7bf66e67b77876439eb0211f327
#. default-sha256: 2592b6012e1bd546cd121c10ea976762b23404ad687e2be48bceda08a321cca4
msgctxt "scenario3:scenario3_AC30B3DE_B94F_4D8D_8073_E6BBF6BCDEC7"
msgid "⟪k:0⟫and yet, he had commissioned it for me without even knowing what I looked like."
msgstr "⟪k:0⟫...et pourtant, il l’avait commandée pour moi sans même savoir à quoi je ressemblais."

#: scenario3:scenario3_B2CFF835_E5E2_4264_878F_C5386AD90A33
#. Edit msgstr; keep protected ⟪k:N⟫ markers in source order.
#. native-sha256: fe83ca10fb0f6ef79aeaa136af6cf8309fe7193c9eda7d85f2251fb064f3b704
#. default-sha256: 919293ce1d48762c68494a54d17b31df3e7d0c5250b15afda117bd2385a12cc7
msgctxt "scenario3:scenario3_B2CFF835_E5E2_4264_878F_C5386AD90A33"
msgid "⟪k:0⟫I was filled with a warm, pleasant elation."
msgstr "⟪k:0⟫J’étais remplie d’allégresse— une joie chaude, agréable m’enveloppait."

#: scenario3:scenario3_C3ADD382_6DBA_4008_BD2C_085E5349AA46
#. Edit msgstr; keep protected ⟪k:N⟫ markers in source order.
#. native-sha256: 214ae502aae0fdab463991f9a355b2c46666f040d51665221c784b8acf9e499d
#. default-sha256: 2ef0790dea5c9f885522c10ae35c389c4883d107356d4f6d131bd5153257b11c
msgctxt "scenario3:scenario3_C3ADD382_6DBA_4008_BD2C_085E5349AA46"
msgid ""
"⟪k:0⟫I agreed with the owner—⟪k:1⟫⟪k:2⟫Jacopo was not a ⟪k:3⟫bad⟪k:4⟫ man.⟪k:5⟫⟪k:6⟫He merely had "
"difficulty expressing himself."
msgstr ""
"⟪k:0⟫J’étais d’accord avec le propriétaire—⟪k:1⟫⟪k:2⟫ Jacopo n’était pas un ⟪k:3⟫méchant⟪k:4⟫ "
"homme.⟪k:5⟫ Il avait simplement des difficultés à s’exprimer."

#: scenario3:scenario3_9391D42B_4DFD_4122_80A1_D807F73929C4
#. Edit msgstr; keep protected ⟪k:N⟫ markers in source order.
#. native-sha256: 1933fb4e98154dfaaf5ece8693a728bb2edc00b7dd32318c6be8f30d3db41737
#. default-sha256: 0dfdb6db071b4a0f02dc181354e74a9d6c9d4a5be5c8e0552baf7211560afbeb
msgctxt "scenario3:scenario3_9391D42B_4DFD_4122_80A1_D807F73929C4"
msgid "⟪k:0⟫Hurrying back to the carriage, I gave him my deepest thanks."
msgstr "⟪k:0⟫Je me dépêchai de retourner à la calèche et le remerciai profondément."

#: scenario3:scenario3_7060EA44_6486_431E_9BE5_104C6DD809B2
#. Edit msgstr; keep protected ⟪k:N⟫ markers in source order.
#. native-sha256: 75c7976e871ffb547d8755bcd9aef19262d50e23addb18b9437320a962bcc3ba
#. default-sha256: 640038ebbbe3a74a272fe5d5df506af455965a7b7399d55f5aa4b6e7633bb710
msgctxt "scenario3:scenario3_7060EA44_6486_431E_9BE5_104C6DD809B2"
msgid ""
"⟪k:0⟫He glanced over at me for a moment, then turned back toward the window and muttered, “yeah.”"
msgstr ""
"⟪k:0⟫Il me regarda pendant un moment puis se tourna vers la fenêtre en murmurant « mouais »."

#: scenario3:scenario3_BA2FD31B_CE8C_495A_A583_F8AD51B1CBFB
#. Edit msgstr; keep protected ⟪k:N⟫ markers in source order.
#. native-sha256: 5d2c1355b78155cb98469643547211148a72ef36ea0a26c4250ca3bb974ce0ac
#. default-sha256: 4d3e16323fbed69eba160ac03e47ee801a2a6655892d36197922c28ebc15750c
msgctxt "scenario3:scenario3_BA2FD31B_CE8C_495A_A583_F8AD51B1CBFB"
msgid "⟪k:0⟫⟪k:1⟫From there, we went to a restaurant for dinner."
msgstr "⟪k:0⟫⟪k:1⟫De là, nous allâmes au restaurant pour le dîner."

#: scenario3:scenario3_20E7C46F_CC16_486C_AA4B_BC363AF22D4A
#. Edit msgstr; keep protected ⟪k:N⟫ markers in source order.
#. native-sha256: 5ae14535393393d0cbb99cc8247ab29ad9f596c514914b8709a56d1c5b02b70d
#. default-sha256: 928769adee7fdc987bc2a12560e81c1aa536076a801489f459f3b78a9054ed28
msgctxt "scenario3:scenario3_20E7C46F_CC16_486C_AA4B_BC363AF22D4A"
msgid ""
"⟪k:0⟫“You call this a pizza?! The crust is an atrocity!⟪k:1⟫It’s like I’m chewing on rubber!”"
msgstr ""
"⟪k:0⟫« Vous appelez ça une pizza ?! La croûte est tout simplement abominable ! On a l’impression "
"de mâcher du caoutchouc ! »"

#: scenario3:scenario3_0B1A017E_BF75_47D5_9F39_564F09E39F3A
#. Edit msgstr; keep protected ⟪k:N⟫ markers in source order.
#. native-sha256: 7955a29f98d1c1fb8f4880bbf37b22e38c8ae643badcb020fd58c88417404d51
#. default-sha256: b95348145c5480d4e33bd505efe8b440bf489c6b8bd59e5666b71b3d2e3e1112
msgctxt "scenario3:scenario3_0B1A017E_BF75_47D5_9F39_564F09E39F3A"
msgid ""
"⟪k:0⟫“How can you wave my country’s flag and not serve spaghetti?!⟪k:1⟫Do you have any shame at "
"all?!”"
msgstr ""
"⟪k:0⟫« Comment osez-vous afficher le drapeau de mon pays et ne pas servir de spaghettis ?! N’avez-"
"vous aucune honte ?! »"

#: scenario3:scenario3_8F1C7A66_6E7B_4A53_A69B_27AE66AFAE91
#. Edit msgstr; keep protected ⟪k:N⟫ markers in source order.
#. native-sha256: 0df48509d62645cc037177721803f2d6c39dc3090698461f7a84dd0f01df6c0e
#. default-sha256: 405f07496c2ea90260e3ad185bd8e556b9b6736793d8c3aa823c4af6cd29845e
msgctxt "scenario3:scenario3_8F1C7A66_6E7B_4A53_A69B_27AE66AFAE91"
msgid ""
"⟪k:0⟫“This wine is pitifully unbalanced! Far too high levels of acidity.⟪k:1⟫Listen to me "
"carefully—⟪k:2⟫⟪k:3⟫the house wine is the face of a restaurant.”"
msgstr ""
"⟪k:0⟫« Ce vin est horriblement déséquilibré. Bien trop acide.⟪k:1⟫⟪k:2⟫É⟪k:3⟫coutez-moi "
"attentivement—⟪k:4⟫⟪k:5⟫ le vin de la maison est la devanture d’un restaurant. »"

#: scenario3:scenario3_E545B29B_B96E_4188_A1EE_6F72C0084E70
#. Edit msgstr; keep protected ⟪k:N⟫ markers in source order.
#. native-sha256: 2c98b134d957696e5bd170f98969f20032aca9c99565187d3e1b4795a346775e
#. default-sha256: 9dd7f0de95791df77f2091516cf3910913fb8819cd8cec01fe6a259c33458d86
msgctxt "scenario3:scenario3_E545B29B_B96E_4188_A1EE_6F72C0084E70"
msgid "⟪k:0⟫He complained about every little thing.⟪k:1⟫It was a complete disaster."
msgstr "⟪k:0⟫Il se plaignait de la moindre petite chose.⟪k:1⟫Ce fut un désastre complet."

#: scenario3:scenario3_A254ECAD_7658_450A_92BC_2199D6436909
#. Edit msgstr; keep protected ⟪k:N⟫ markers in source order.
#. native-sha256: 790d0888b29da97d7733b36e57bcbaa499f28836f1e8976620b47470e46fdbab
#. default-sha256: a97e27dfd0f7192c823c6f530e2f9545c62fc5d6288582e6da3946d1178a11d7
msgctxt "scenario3:scenario3_A254ECAD_7658_450A_92BC_2199D6436909"
msgid "⟪k:0⟫But curiously enough, I was not at all put off by his behavior."
msgstr "⟪k:0⟫Mais assez curieusement, son comportement ne me rebutait pas le moins du monde."

#: scenario3:scenario3_37341C46_68D0_414F_BD92_A328C2B42AEB
#. Edit msgstr; keep protected ⟪k:N⟫ markers in source order.
#. native-sha256: 83f770f9b8afbcb6070771543623dae3736c3c9b902c8f7ea59f908ad7c607cb
#. default-sha256: fa89e17b5b8630d5b170e3e3f5d4dca9734a6592cff72236ec4c59bfd9882ec1
msgctxt "scenario3:scenario3_37341C46_68D0_414F_BD92_A328C2B42AEB"
msgid "⟪k:0⟫When the sun set, the carriage made its way to a nearby hill."
msgstr "⟪k:0⟫Au coucher du soleil, la calèche se dirigea vers une colline voisine."

#: scenario3:scenario3_CBFD4E31_60FE_4758_A625_B5ADCFDA86A1
#. Edit msgstr; keep protected ⟪k:N⟫ markers in source order.
#. native-sha256: cf97fb9a74fdbcbd0e7405e483da85e431467d97a508c9b342f62d8c1478d333
#. default-sha256: ebb0ebbdcbf8367a2f9d5ff3fa12cd5ccc068b2c52eec9f3f49bb5336a264c29
msgctxt "scenario3:scenario3_CBFD4E31_60FE_4758_A625_B5ADCFDA86A1"
msgid ""
"⟪k:0⟫The cool nighttime breeze felt wonderful on my skin, flushed from the alcohol, and the light "
"from the gas lamps had a comforting warmth to it."
msgstr ""
"⟪k:0⟫La brise fraîche, cette nuit-là, caressait ma peau, rougie par l’alcool, et la lumière des "
"becs de gaz prodiguait une chaleur réconfortante."

#: scenario3:scenario3_F62BFFF2_3194_4D9C_A208_7AC7635AAB0C
#. Edit msgstr; keep protected ⟪k:N⟫ markers in source order.
#. native-sha256: fdb11ba5f286d96778a313540e5d040abd4816b06f9b752f68e5729e02f4e8bb
#. default-sha256: 0eabee582b9f73417fcb8e62790e78730a40783b1d6fd5e40b252c171eb4db98
msgctxt "scenario3:scenario3_F62BFFF2_3194_4D9C_A208_7AC7635AAB0C"
msgid ""
"⟪k:0⟫Though Jacopo had complained about the quality of the wine, once he had intoxicated himself, "
"his mood improved visibly. ⟪k:1⟫It made him unexpectedly talkative."
msgstr ""
"⟪k:0⟫Même si Jacopo s’était plaint de la qualité du vin, une fois qu’il était ivre, son humeur "
"s’était considérablement améliorée. ⟪k:1⟫Contre toute attente, cela le rendait bavard."

#: scenario3:scenario3_4BB2CF95_DFA5_4CAB_BBA6_69281459B5AE
#. Edit msgstr; keep protected ⟪k:N⟫ markers in source order.
#. native-sha256: c9e78b3104af0d39f14f5cdc9d7744e683283fd6400eeb6432255e318e652154
#. default-sha256: acb5b930a107dba73dc705e6d61b12dfeabd1d391963707d1ac7b975d662448d
msgctxt "scenario3:scenario3_4BB2CF95_DFA5_4CAB_BBA6_69281459B5AE"
msgid ""
"⟪k:0⟫⟪k:1⟫⟪k:2⟫⟪k:3⟫⟪k:4⟫⟪k:5⟫⟪k:6⟫⟪k:7⟫Look out at the city.⟪k:8⟫⟪k:9⟫A gloomy town that shuts "
"down at night isn’t suited to expansion or growth. But this city isn’t like that."
msgstr ""
"⟪k:0⟫⟪k:1⟫⟪k:2⟫⟪k:3⟫⟪k:4⟫⟪k:5⟫⟪k:6⟫⟪k:7⟫Regardez la ville.⟪k:8⟫⟪k:9⟫Une ville lugubre qui "
"s’éteint la nuit ne connaîtra pas de développement ni de croissance. Mais cette ville n’est pas "
"comme ça."

#: scenario3:scenario3_14472A94_21AB_417A_A65C_D703EBC95D8B
#. Edit msgstr; keep protected ⟪k:N⟫ markers in source order.
#. native-sha256: 215c0b0f31f23780c0b3f3865df4373ee647455a8d88a5d226c34fa7027afa5f
#. default-sha256: e0c0e288983bd3430dcf3ec4b21c7e61698c50507de43fd22a964b6da50ac9c6
msgctxt "scenario3:scenario3_14472A94_21AB_417A_A65C_D703EBC95D8B"
msgid ""
"⟪k:0⟫You can see people walking beneath the lamps,⟪k:1⟫and you can hear the bustle of them "
"talking."
msgstr ""
"⟪k:0⟫On voit les gens marcher sous les lampadaires,⟪k:1⟫on entend le vacarme de leurs "
"conversations."

#: scenario3:scenario3_709A2976_748E_4697_B6D1_575115A0CB1F
#. Edit msgstr; keep protected ⟪k:N⟫ markers in source order.
#. native-sha256: a62e7d531338be318ca0e93c2676d522108d90e5906289a919ab89356e6b8a4b
#. default-sha256: 0f512a141fe3cd52f1f427c5397165e6644e3131a5cb2810ede23fd4d6d8bec9
msgctxt "scenario3:scenario3_709A2976_748E_4697_B6D1_575115A0CB1F"
msgid ""
"⟪k:0⟫This is a city that still has plenty of room to grow.⟪k:1⟫⟪k:2⟫As they ride the rising wave "
"of the economy,⟪k:3⟫many, many more people will gather here."
msgstr ""
"⟪k:0⟫C’est une ville qui a encore plein d’espace pour se développer.⟪k:1⟫⟪k:2⟫Beaucoup de gens "
"vont monter dans la locomotive du progrès,⟪k:3⟫et s’installer dans cette ville, s’y rassembler."

#: scenario3:scenario3_299E2B51_7F4E_4F47_8D97_6C4CCC79ACDF
#. Edit msgstr; keep protected ⟪k:N⟫ markers in source order.
