msgctxt "scenario3:scenario3_4136B471_10CD_4893_A969_986808AAED08"
msgid ""
"⟪k:0⟫⟪k:1⟫It can be difficult to see what’s happening from the inside.⟪k:2⟫⟪k:3⟫The majority of "
"people just go about their daily lives,⟪k:4⟫and the next thing they know, things are different."
msgstr ""
"⟪k:0⟫⟪k:1⟫De l’intérieur, ça peut être compliqué de voir ce qui se passe.⟪k:2⟫⟪k:3⟫La majorité "
"des gens ne font que vaquer à leurs occupations,⟪k:4⟫et avant même qu’ils ne s’en rendent compte, "
"les choses ont changé."

#: scenario3:scenario3_39734B13_3D4C_4B9B_A507_3A350D7C0483
#. Edit msgstr; keep protected ⟪k:N⟫ markers in source order.
#. native-sha256: fec885ac9592cf37bc26e68e4f4614a6dd4da2a246529366a1a8824e12573b32
#. default-sha256: a03f0ce6d9d76e846acd1f418edd8dd67aa229b961423191991be81c48370cfc
msgctxt "scenario3:scenario3_39734B13_3D4C_4B9B_A507_3A350D7C0483"
msgid "⟪k:0⟫⟪k:1⟫No—⟪k:2⟫⟪k:3⟫I’d wager most don’t notice the changes at all."
msgstr ""
"⟪k:0⟫⟪k:1⟫Non—⟪k:2⟫⟪k:3⟫ je parierais que la plupart ne remarquent même pas les changements."

#: scenario3:scenario3_C6C73090_D254_45AD_A1CB_9FE8662CAAFC
#. Edit msgstr; keep protected ⟪k:N⟫ markers in source order.
#. native-sha256: df6c5dab9503227193d12341568441de0e047da5202d372ebdda36c496f81c79
