msgstr "⟪k:0⟫⟪k:1⟫Avez-vous... ⟪k:2⟫un rêve ?"

#: scenario3:scenario3_CECB563B_414E_41C5_B847_5E0AD4392C78
#. Edit msgstr; keep protected ⟪k:N⟫ markers in source order.
